%3AAID-EURO184%3E3.0.CO%3B2-4" class="external text" id="mwyw">10.1002/(SICI)1234-981X(199707)5:3<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwzA">&lt;</span>305::AID-EURO184<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwzQ">></span>3.0.CO<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwzg">;</span>2-4</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/S2CID_(identifier)" title="S2CID (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwzw">S2CID</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mw0A"> </span><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://api.semanticscholar.org/CorpusID:145644958" class="external text" id="mw0Q">145644958</a>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=European+Review&amp;rft.atitle=%27Improving+ratings%27%3A+audit+in+the+British+University+system&amp;rft.volume=5&amp;rft.issue=3&amp;rft.pages=305-321&amp;rft.date=1997&amp;rft_id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1002%2F%28SICI%291234-981X%28199707%295%3A3%3C305%3A%3AAID-EURO184%3E3.0.CO%3B2-4&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fapi.semanticscholar.org%2FCorpusID%3A145644958%23id-name%3DS2CID&amp;rft.aulast=Strathern&amp;rft.aufirst=Marilyn&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Farchive.org%2Fdetails%2FImprovingRatingsAuditInTheBritishUniversitySystem&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AGoodhart%27s+law" class="Z3988" id="mw0g"></span></span></li>
